# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Quantum workflows often take a while to complete and can run over many sessions. Restarting your Python kernel means you'll lose any results stored in memory. To avoid loss of data, you can save results to file and retrieve results of past jobs from IBM Quantum&reg; so your next session can continue where you left off.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Aliran kerja kuantum sering mengambil masa yang lama untuk diselesaikan dan boleh berjalan merentas banyak Session. Memulakan semula kernel Python bermakna anda akan kehilangan sebarang keputusan yang tersimpan dalam ingatan. Untuk mengelakkan kehilangan data, anda boleh menyimpan keputusan ke fail dan mengambil semula keputusan kerja lampau dari IBM Quantum&reg; supaya Session seterusnya boleh meneruskan dari mana anda berhenti.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve job results from IBM Quantum {#retrieve-job-results-from-ibm-quantum}"
msgstr "Ambil semula keputusan kerja dari IBM Quantum {#retrieve-job-results-from-ibm-quantum}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum automatically stores results from every job for you to retrieve at a later date. Use this feature to continue quantum programs across kernel restarts and review past results. You can get the ID of a job programmatically through its `job_id` method, or you can see all your submitted jobs and their IDs on the [Workloads page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum secara automatik menyimpan keputusan dari setiap kerja untuk anda ambil semula pada tarikh kemudian. Gunakan ciri ini untuk meneruskan program kuantum merentas permulaan semula kernel dan menyemak keputusan lampau. Anda boleh mendapatkan ID kerja secara aturcara melalui kaedah `job_id`-nya, atau anda boleh melihat semua kerja yang telah dihantar dan ID mereka pada [halaman Beban Kerja](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To find a job programmatically, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) method. By default, this returns the most recently submitted jobs, but you can also filter jobs by backend name, creation date, and more. The following cell finds any jobs submitted in the last three months. The `created_after` argument must be a [`datetime.datetime`](https://docs.python.org/3.8/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime) object.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mencari kerja secara aturcara, gunakan kaedah [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs). Secara lalai, ini mengembalikan kerja yang paling baru dihantar, tetapi anda juga boleh menapis kerja mengikut nama Backend, tarikh penciptaan, dan banyak lagi. Sel berikut mencari sebarang kerja yang dihantar dalam tiga bulan terakhir. Argumen `created_after` mestilah objek [`datetime.datetime`](https://docs.python.org/3.8/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also select by backend, job state, session, and more. For more information, see [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) in the API documentation.\n"
msgstr "Anda juga boleh memilih mengikut Backend, status kerja, Session, dan banyak lagi. Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat [`QiskitRuntimeService.jobs`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#jobs) dalam dokumentasi API.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have the job ID, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.job`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#job) method to retrieve it.\n"
msgstr "Setelah anda mempunyai ID kerja, gunakan kaedah [`QiskitRuntimeService.job`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#job) untuk mengambilnya semula.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save results to disk {#save-results-to-disk}"
msgstr "Simpan keputusan ke cakera {#save-results-to-disk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You may also want to save results to disk. To do this, use Python's built-in JSON library with encoders from `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
msgstr "Anda mungkin juga mahu menyimpan keputusan ke cakera. Untuk melakukan ini, gunakan pustaka JSON terbina dalam Python dengan pengekod dari `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can then load this array from disk in a separate kernel.\n"
msgstr "Anda kemudian boleh memuatkan tatasusunan ini dari cakera dalam kernel yang berasingan.\n"
